OL,3,GNEWSAYoung drivers offered post-crash
OL,4,Asafety training
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road safety programme for young
OL,7,Fpeople is being expanded to teach
OL,8,Fdrivers and passengers what to do after
OL,9,Fa crash.
OL,11,FThe Young Driver and Passenger
OL,12,Fprogramme is available to Year 12 and
OL,13,F13 students across Kent and Medway and
OL,14,Fcurrently consists of four virtual
OL,15,Fsessions.
OL,17,FA fifth session has now been added,
OL,18,Fwhich will give young people advice on
OL,19,Fwhat to do if they are involved in or
OL,20,Fwitness a collision.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
