OL,3,GNEWSAYoung drivers offered post-crash
OL,4,Asafety training
OL,5,
OL,6,FFigures from Kent County Council (KCC)
OL,7,Fshow 123 passengers aged between 17 and
OL,8,F24 were killed or seriously injured in
OL,9,FKent and Medway between 1 January 2023
OL,10,Fand 31 December 2025. Of those, 72%
OL,11,Fwere travelling in vehicles driven by
OL,12,Fsomeone aged between 17 and 24.
